# The umbrella holds documents and two submodules; everything else in its root
# is local. Each submodule ignores its own build, data and IDE files.

# Working folders of the coding tools: scratch worktrees (a full second copy of
# the project) and machine-local settings.
.claude/
.kilo/
.kilocode/

# Visual Studio keeps its own folder beside what it opened, and it opens the
# workspace root; Qt Creator and VS Code do the same.
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user

# Release packages of build-packages.bat: Build/Windows, Build/Android,
# Build/Linux. They are made, not kept.
/Build/

# Builds started from the root (cmake -S Calendar -B build/planner, see
# README.md) and stray CMake folders.
/build/
/build-*/
CMakeFiles/

# A bundle of an old history and similar backups.
*.bundle

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

.mcp.json